{"channelId":"UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","row":["Lifespring Chiropractic",32900,"Most people think they're healthy until their body says otherwise.\n\nIf you care about your health and try to do all the right things but you're still dealing with fatigue, recurring pain, hormone shifts, brain fog, or just feeling off, this channel is for you.\n\nWe don't treat the body like a machine. We treat it like a plant.\n\nWhen something starts wilting, you don't tape the leaf back on. You check the roots. The root system of your body is the nervous system, the brain and spinal cord that control energy, recovery, digestion, focus, performance, and pain.\nLifespring is a chiropractic office in Austin, Texas serving young professionals, athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone who's tired of chasing symptoms and ready to understand why their body keeps sending the same signals.\n\nHere you'll see real patient stories, real diagnostic scans, and real changes in function. No quick fixes. No noise.\nReady to find the root? Book your first visit at lifespringchiro.com.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:41.057Z","channelId":"UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"60b476ca8593889f271375273755324fc68a435a0dc18bd3f96432d317703e12","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"4cfa6a02e312d118a39ada3fe4a63dc04a039cb4167f61e8c5ac394bcf4d902b"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:22:19.235Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":32900,"raw":"32.9K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO-4VnRZ6VPtAuN5c1DtKzA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:41.057Z"}]